%% Three lifelines: CLIENT, AI-DESK, DATAHUB.
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as CLIENT<br/>enterprise search<br/>structured · unstructured
    participant A as AI-DESK
    participant H as DATAHUB

    C->>A: the question — one search box over the whole estate
    A->>A: 1 finds the right repository and tables
    A->>A: 2 writes the query
    A->>A: 3 validates it before anything runs
    A->>H: runs the query on the source
    H-->>A: reflects the rows back
    A->>A: reads the data reflected back and infers —<br/>analysis and charts before the client sees anything
    A-->>C: insight, not just rows — with evidence
